# their place on an ANSI keyboard, and a lone modifier (lcmd, rcmd, lalt, ralt, lctrl, rctrl,
# lshift, rshift) runs its action when it is tapped on its own. Adding a chord again replaces
# it, so this file can run again; removing every hotkey first also drops the ones it no longer
# adds. `yabai hotkey add --help` describes every chord, and `yabai hotkey list` prints them.
#
